# ---- Traces recorded from the real code (a matched trace reaches its last state) ----
# A __tamper_<var> variant alters one variable in the final state and must NOT be matched.
# A __knockout configuration checks a trace without the defect switch it demonstrates and must
# NOT be matched either. A __witness configuration checks a trace against the property its defect
# breaks, which the trace must violate.

